1
00:00:51,560 --> 00:00:52,220
Chief Zhou.

2
00:00:52,400 --> 00:00:53,530
I'd like to follow up

3
00:00:54,080 --> 00:00:55,280
on Wang Hong.

4
00:00:55,600 --> 00:00:56,440
Wang Hong?

5
00:00:57,040 --> 00:00:57,600
Yes.

6
00:00:57,880 --> 00:01:00,360
Isn't he the victim in Teng Xiaohu's case?

7
00:01:00,440 --> 00:01:02,520
He's also a prime suspect in Liu Ming's case.

8
00:01:02,520 --> 00:01:04,519
How did you come to that conclusion?

9
00:01:05,040 --> 00:01:05,760
Intuition.

10
00:01:09,360 --> 00:01:10,039
Old Zhou.

11
00:01:11,080 --> 00:01:11,920
I think

12
00:01:12,160 --> 00:01:13,880
the explosion at Zhao Zhiguo's house

13
00:01:13,880 --> 00:01:16,160
is definitely related to that accident.

14
00:01:16,480 --> 00:01:17,800
I trust my intuition.

15
00:01:18,160 --> 00:01:19,480
After this investigation,

16
00:01:19,480 --> 00:01:21,010
if there are still no clues,

17
00:01:21,800 --> 00:01:22,880
I'll let it go.

18
00:01:24,080 --> 00:01:25,340
I'll listen to you then

19
00:01:25,520 --> 00:01:27,320
and step back to the second line.

20
00:01:28,560 --> 00:01:29,440
Cao Jin.

21
00:01:29,560 --> 00:01:31,520
As a police officer,

22
00:01:31,880 --> 00:01:34,610
it's good to trust your intuition occasionally.

23
00:01:34,800 --> 00:01:36,200
But when we handle cases,

24
00:01:36,800 --> 00:01:39,000
we need evidence for everything.

25
00:01:40,120 --> 00:01:41,880
If you have any new clues,

26
00:01:41,880 --> 00:01:43,400
I will do my best

27
00:01:43,560 --> 00:01:45,680
to support you at all costs.

28
00:01:48,280 --> 00:01:48,960
But

29
00:01:49,600 --> 00:01:52,000
if you only rely on your intuition

30
00:01:52,600 --> 00:01:53,729
and it's illogical,

31
00:01:54,600 --> 00:01:57,240
our investigation will hit a dead end

32
00:01:58,000 --> 00:01:59,860
and put the cart before the horse.

33
00:02:01,000 --> 00:02:02,360
Understood, Chief Zhou.

34
00:02:02,360 --> 00:02:03,620
I'll go arrange it now.

35
00:02:04,400 --> 00:02:05,280
I'll lead a team tonight

36
00:02:05,280 --> 00:02:06,360
to search a few important locations

37
00:02:06,360 --> 00:02:07,400
again.

38
00:02:07,680 --> 00:02:10,479
I'll report any new developments to you promptly.

39
00:02:10,880 --> 00:02:11,560
All right.

40
00:02:12,680 --> 00:02:13,960
Make sure to stay safe.

41
00:02:14,720 --> 00:02:15,450
Understood.

42
00:02:16,840 --> 00:02:18,370
I'll leave you to your work.

43
00:02:21,360 --> 00:02:22,200
Old Cao.

44
00:02:23,640 --> 00:02:24,920
This son of yours

45
00:02:26,840 --> 00:02:27,900
is really like you.

46
00:02:31,000 --> 00:02:32,320
That was so exciting.

47
00:02:32,640 --> 00:02:33,300
Uncle Wang.

48
00:02:33,640 --> 00:02:35,440
Is this what you guys usually do?

49
00:02:36,760 --> 00:02:37,960
What do you mean?

50
00:02:38,240 --> 00:02:39,079
Following us?

51
00:02:39,600 --> 00:02:40,930
Mind your own business.

52
00:02:41,120 --> 00:02:42,520
What do you mean by following?

53
00:02:42,520 --> 00:02:43,920
I can go wherever I want.

54
00:02:43,920 --> 00:02:45,640
I was treating Xuefei to skewers.

55
00:02:45,640 --> 00:02:47,240
Who knew you guys would be driving a tricycle.

56
00:02:47,240 --> 00:02:48,360
So sneakily.

57
00:02:48,360 --> 00:02:50,220
Of course we had to follow and see.

58
00:02:50,600 --> 00:02:51,800
You were up to no good.

59
00:02:51,840 --> 00:02:52,920
Thanks to Xuefei.

60
00:02:53,079 --> 00:02:53,640
Alright.

61
00:02:53,760 --> 00:02:55,160
You're also in the wrong.

62
00:02:55,240 --> 00:02:56,360
I told you not to follow me.

63
00:02:56,360 --> 00:02:57,600
It's dangerous.

64
00:02:57,800 --> 00:02:58,960
If something happened to you,

65
00:02:58,960 --> 00:02:59,890
what would we do?

66
00:03:00,160 --> 00:03:01,160
Xuefei.

67
00:03:01,480 --> 00:03:03,920
You went into someone else's factory alone in the middle of the night.

68
00:03:03,920 --> 00:03:05,880
Who knows if you were doing something good or bad?

69
00:03:05,880 --> 00:03:07,480
If it's good, I can join in.

70
00:03:07,640 --> 00:03:08,600
If it's dangerous,

71
00:03:08,600 --> 00:03:09,960
I could be of help.

72
00:03:11,840 --> 00:03:13,240
Mr. Wang, say something.

73
00:03:14,120 --> 00:03:15,800
At least introduce us.

74
00:03:16,880 --> 00:03:17,520
Alright.

75
00:03:18,720 --> 00:03:19,520
Kid.

76
00:03:19,720 --> 00:03:20,579
Let me tell you.

77
00:03:20,680 --> 00:03:22,600
You better keep this a secret today.

78
00:03:22,600 --> 00:03:23,520
Even to your mom.

79
00:03:23,520 --> 00:03:24,480
You can't say a word.

80
00:03:24,480 --> 00:03:25,840
Otherwise, I'll teach you a lesson.

81
00:03:25,840 --> 00:03:27,600
Are you crazy? Why so fierce?

82
00:03:28,120 --> 00:03:28,800
If it weren't for me,

83
00:03:28,800 --> 00:03:31,320
who knows what would have happened to you today.

84
00:03:31,320 --> 00:03:31,880
Also.

85
00:03:32,160 --> 00:03:33,120
Don't call me a kid.

86
00:03:33,120 --> 00:03:34,800
Acting like you're so old.

87
00:03:35,120 --> 00:03:37,960
You just love acting like an adult in front of girls.

88
00:03:37,960 --> 00:03:38,840
What a poser.

89
00:03:39,280 --> 00:03:39,800
No.

90
00:03:40,240 --> 00:03:40,920
Come on.

91
00:03:41,680 --> 00:03:43,740
Don't stoop to a little girl's level.

92
00:03:44,160 --> 00:03:44,880
Uncle Wang,

93
00:03:45,079 --> 00:03:47,280
are you guys investigating something?

94
00:03:47,480 --> 00:03:48,920
You're our family's benefactor.

95
00:03:48,920 --> 00:03:50,360
If you're investigating something,

96
00:03:50,360 --> 00:03:52,160
just come to me when you're in Xinchun.

97
00:03:52,160 --> 00:03:52,840
I'm not lying to you.

98
00:03:52,840 --> 00:03:54,120
I can really help.

99
00:03:55,240 --> 00:03:55,880
Alright.

100
00:03:56,040 --> 00:03:56,920
Stop dawdling.

101
00:03:57,440 --> 00:03:58,840
It has nothing to do with you.

102
00:03:58,840 --> 00:03:59,840
You're like a kid.

103
00:04:00,040 --> 00:04:01,200
Remember to take me with you.

104
00:04:01,200 --> 00:04:02,280
I'll come again tomorrow.

105
00:04:02,280 --> 00:04:03,640
I can definitely help.

106
00:04:04,400 --> 00:04:05,280
Why haven't you left yet?

107
00:04:05,280 --> 00:04:06,040
Take me with you.

108
00:04:06,040 --> 00:04:06,920
You talk too much.

109
00:04:06,920 --> 00:04:08,120
Don't fight, you two.

110
00:04:08,480 --> 00:04:09,740
Brother, I'm leaving.

111
00:04:14,640 --> 00:04:15,700
I'm going to sleep.

112
00:04:15,760 --> 00:04:16,560
You guys chat.

113
00:04:33,120 --> 00:04:33,760
Mr. Wang.

114
00:04:34,520 --> 00:04:36,580
We've been through so much together.

115
00:04:36,840 --> 00:04:38,900
We can be considered friends, right?

116
00:04:39,360 --> 00:04:41,600
Isn't it better to make some things clear?

117
00:04:41,600 --> 00:04:42,720
After all, misunderstandings

118
00:04:42,720 --> 00:04:44,520
are caused by no one speaking up.

119
00:04:46,520 --> 00:04:47,240
Miss Li.

120
00:04:48,760 --> 00:04:50,120
I know you approached me

121
00:04:50,560 --> 00:04:52,420
not just for your father's order.

122
00:04:53,080 --> 00:04:54,680
You're looking for someone.

123
00:04:59,000 --> 00:05:00,160
If you don't tell me,

124
00:05:00,480 --> 00:05:01,400
I won't ask.

125
00:05:02,400 --> 00:05:04,660
After all, everyone has secrets, right?

126
00:05:06,640 --> 00:05:08,100
I'm looking for my mother.

127
00:05:11,960 --> 00:05:13,840
On New Year's Eve sixteen years ago,

128
00:05:13,840 --> 00:05:15,170
my mom ran away from home

129
00:05:16,440 --> 00:05:17,570
and never came back.

130
00:05:17,800 --> 00:05:19,720
Xuefei, Mom is going out for a bit.

131
00:05:20,320 --> 00:05:20,920
Here are some dumplings.

132
00:05:20,920 --> 00:05:22,360
Eat them first if you get hungry later.

133
00:05:22,360 --> 00:05:23,360
Don't wait for me.

134
00:05:24,640 --> 00:05:25,840
I'll be right back.

135
00:05:35,000 --> 00:05:37,460
I've been looking for clues all these years.

136
00:05:38,640 --> 00:05:39,500
What about you?

137
00:05:40,240 --> 00:05:41,640
What are you looking for?

138
00:05:52,120 --> 00:05:53,600
That wood used to belong to my family.

139
00:05:53,600 --> 00:05:54,360
If you help me get it back,

140
00:05:54,360 --> 00:05:55,320
you can have as much as you want.

141
00:05:55,320 --> 00:05:56,780
Stop the car. Stop the car.

142
00:05:57,080 --> 00:05:59,280
Stop the car. Stop the car. Stop the car.

143
00:06:04,640 --> 00:06:06,170
Looking for a batch of wood.

144
00:06:06,360 --> 00:06:07,000
Wood?

145
00:06:07,560 --> 00:06:08,890
I didn't come to Xinchun

146
00:06:09,320 --> 00:06:11,200
to collect wood for coffins,

147
00:06:12,600 --> 00:06:13,400
but to find a batch of

148
00:06:13,400 --> 00:06:15,400
old Korean pine that disappeared 16 years ago.

149
00:06:15,400 --> 00:06:16,800
So Lin Shengli,

150
00:06:16,800 --> 00:06:17,720
Teng Xiaohu,

151
00:06:17,840 --> 00:06:19,900
and our Li family are all helping you.

152
00:06:23,600 --> 00:06:24,720
It seems

153
00:06:24,960 --> 00:06:26,840
we might be on the same path.

154
00:06:28,160 --> 00:06:29,240
You look for your wood,

155
00:06:29,240 --> 00:06:30,560
and I look for my people.

156
00:06:30,560 --> 00:06:33,159
As long as we don't harm each other's interests,

157
00:06:33,159 --> 00:06:34,560
maybe we can cooperate.

158
00:06:38,080 --> 00:06:39,610
Pleasure working with you.

159
00:06:40,600 --> 00:06:42,080
Since we are partners now,

160
00:06:42,800 --> 00:06:43,800
there's no need to be so polite.

161
00:06:43,800 --> 00:06:45,659
Just call me by my name from now on.

162
00:06:47,040 --> 00:06:49,560
But there's one thing I need to make clear in advance.

163
00:06:49,560 --> 00:06:50,400
I need you to give me

164
00:06:50,400 --> 00:06:52,260
the most basic respect and trust.

165
00:06:53,080 --> 00:06:54,080
As for the past,

166
00:06:54,080 --> 00:06:55,680
we won't hold each other accountable

167
00:06:55,680 --> 00:06:56,680
or ask questions.

168
00:06:57,200 --> 00:06:58,720
But if there's another incident like tonight,

169
00:06:58,720 --> 00:07:00,920
breaking into someone else's factory at night,

170
00:07:00,920 --> 00:07:03,000
I hope I have the basic right to know.

171
00:07:05,640 --> 00:07:06,570
I'll try my best.

172
00:07:14,520 --> 00:07:17,000
Mr. Wang, you mean

173
00:07:18,840 --> 00:07:20,640
you want to invest in my factory?

174
00:07:22,360 --> 00:07:23,400
I'll provide the funds

175
00:07:23,400 --> 00:07:24,720
to increase production capacity

176
00:07:24,720 --> 00:07:26,000
and upgrade equipment.

177
00:07:26,000 --> 00:07:27,880
You'll be in charge of production and management,

178
00:07:27,880 --> 00:07:29,540
and Xuefei will handle sales.

179
00:07:29,600 --> 00:07:30,660
As for the profits,

180
00:07:30,960 --> 00:07:32,890
we'll share them proportionally.

181
00:07:33,040 --> 00:07:35,240
Director Chen, please take a look at the contract.

182
00:07:35,240 --> 00:07:37,840
If you have any questions, we can discuss them.

183
00:07:41,360 --> 00:07:43,820
I'm afraid you're not here to ask for a favor.

184
00:07:44,480 --> 00:07:45,560
Just say it.

185
00:07:46,240 --> 00:07:47,440
I've seen you before.

186
00:07:50,880 --> 00:07:51,760
Who are you?

187
00:07:52,880 --> 00:07:53,940
Sixteen years ago.

188
00:07:54,600 --> 00:07:56,400
An old friend of the Zhao family.

189
00:07:56,840 --> 00:07:58,000
Stop the car! Stop!

190
00:07:58,520 --> 00:08:00,760
Stop the car! Stop! Stop!

191
00:08:01,320 --> 00:08:02,080
It's you.

192
00:08:02,840 --> 00:08:04,370
For the past sixteen years,

193
00:08:04,920 --> 00:08:07,250
I've never given up looking for the truth.

194
00:08:07,600 --> 00:08:08,520
The truth?

195
00:08:09,120 --> 00:08:10,720
The two incidents back then,

196
00:08:11,880 --> 00:08:13,810
I don't think they were accidents.

197
00:08:20,320 --> 00:08:21,450
Then what were they?

198
00:08:21,880 --> 00:08:23,210
I haven't found out yet.

199
00:08:24,800 --> 00:08:25,860
But Director Chen,

200
00:08:26,400 --> 00:08:27,400
I need your help.

201
00:08:33,360 --> 00:08:35,360
We brought this all upon ourselves.

202
00:08:36,039 --> 00:08:37,970
This is our family's retribution.

203
00:08:38,240 --> 00:08:39,039
Mr. Wang.

204
00:08:39,919 --> 00:08:41,520
You've got the wrong person.

205
00:08:41,600 --> 00:08:44,400
You should know very well why I came back this time.

206
00:08:44,400 --> 00:08:46,000
If our goals are the same,

207
00:08:47,160 --> 00:08:48,490
I hope we can cooperate.

208
00:08:51,040 --> 00:08:53,240
Not just because of the current hatred,

209
00:08:53,320 --> 00:08:55,720
but also because of everything in the past.

210
00:08:56,560 --> 00:08:58,160
Thank you for your kindness.

211
00:08:59,080 --> 00:09:01,440
The past has been weighing on my mind for a long time.

212
00:09:01,440 --> 00:09:03,040
The dead cannot be brought back to life.

213
00:09:03,040 --> 00:09:05,040
These hatreds and resentments,

214
00:09:06,520 --> 00:09:08,320
I don't want to dwell on them anymore.

215
00:09:08,320 --> 00:09:09,320
As for me,

216
00:09:12,160 --> 00:09:13,440
as long as our girl,

217
00:09:13,880 --> 00:09:14,720
Chen Nian,

218
00:09:15,200 --> 00:09:17,200
is safe and healthy, that's enough.

219
00:09:17,800 --> 00:09:20,330
If escaping can cover the scars in your heart,

220
00:09:22,440 --> 00:09:23,970
then I respect your choice.

221
00:09:24,480 --> 00:09:25,160
Let's go.

222
00:09:26,760 --> 00:09:27,560
Wait a minute.

223
00:09:29,240 --> 00:09:29,880
Mom.

224
00:09:30,680 --> 00:09:32,280
What are you hesitating for?

225
00:09:34,480 --> 00:09:35,840
Can't you see?

226
00:09:36,000 --> 00:09:38,200
Uncle Wang genuinely wants to help us.

227
00:09:41,000 --> 00:09:42,160
Let's work together.

228
00:09:42,160 --> 00:09:44,160
Then we'll see who dares to bully us.

229
00:09:44,160 --> 00:09:45,200
I'm talking to Mr. Wang.

230
00:09:45,200 --> 00:09:47,060
You're a child. Don't interrupt.

231
00:09:47,120 --> 00:09:48,320
Stay in your room.

232
00:09:48,800 --> 00:09:50,000
If it works, we cooperate.

233
00:09:50,000 --> 00:09:51,120
If not, we split.

234
00:09:51,200 --> 00:09:52,480
It's such a simple logic.

235
00:09:52,480 --> 00:09:54,800
Why do you keep pushing me away?

236
00:09:55,160 --> 00:09:56,960
Is it as simple as you think?

237
00:09:57,160 --> 00:09:57,800
This kid...

238
00:09:57,800 --> 00:10:00,000
You're just overcomplicating things.

239
00:10:01,240 --> 00:10:03,760
I believe Uncle Wang won't trick us.

240
00:10:05,480 --> 00:10:07,480
Stay in your room and don't come out.

241
00:10:15,560 --> 00:10:16,520
Some enemies,

242
00:10:17,080 --> 00:10:18,280
even if they don't attack,

243
00:10:18,280 --> 00:10:20,140
it doesn't mean they've given up.

244
00:10:20,480 --> 00:10:22,610
Do you think I'm right, Director Chen?

245
00:10:22,960 --> 00:10:23,960
As for the result,

246
00:10:25,120 --> 00:10:26,850
it all depends on human effort.

247
00:10:29,160 --> 00:10:31,440
Uncle Wang, I'll agree on my mom's behalf.

248
00:10:31,440 --> 00:10:32,970
To a pleasant cooperation.

249
00:10:35,280 --> 00:10:36,140
Director Chen.

250
00:10:40,360 --> 00:10:41,040
Okay.

251
00:10:42,000 --> 00:10:43,730
It all depends on human effort.

252
00:10:46,240 --> 00:10:47,480
Come on, catch it.

253
00:10:47,480 --> 00:10:48,560
Coming.

254
00:10:48,760 --> 00:10:49,960
Dumplings.

255
00:10:50,280 --> 00:10:51,680
The dumplings are ready.

256
00:10:52,840 --> 00:10:54,100
Third Aunt's cooking.

257
00:10:54,560 --> 00:10:55,640
What's the filling?

258
00:10:55,640 --> 00:10:56,440
Pickled cabbage, right?

259
00:10:56,440 --> 00:10:57,480
Come on, you must be hungry.

260
00:10:57,480 --> 00:10:58,720
Third Aunt, what's the filling?

261
00:10:58,720 --> 00:10:59,720
Pickled cabbage.

262
00:10:59,800 --> 00:11:01,200
It's my favorite.

263
00:11:02,520 --> 00:11:03,440
Eat as much as you want.

264
00:11:03,440 --> 00:11:04,000
Thanks for your hard work.

265
00:11:04,000 --> 00:11:04,640
Have a seat.

266
00:11:04,640 --> 00:11:05,360
It's nothing.

267
00:11:05,360 --> 00:11:05,960
Come on.

268
00:11:07,360 --> 00:11:08,120
Well,

269
00:11:08,600 --> 00:11:09,800
let me say something.

270
00:11:10,720 --> 00:11:13,040
First, let's welcome our new friend.

271
00:11:13,720 --> 00:11:15,160
And I wish Director Chen

272
00:11:15,160 --> 00:11:16,600
and Miss Li's factories

273
00:11:16,600 --> 00:11:17,800
all the best. Cheers.

274
00:11:19,040 --> 00:11:19,500
Cheers.

275
00:11:19,600 --> 00:11:20,400
All the best.

276
00:11:22,120 --> 00:11:23,240
To a prosperous business.

277
00:11:23,240 --> 00:11:24,770
To a pleasant cooperation.

278
00:11:26,120 --> 00:11:27,380
What's your real name?

279
00:11:28,120 --> 00:11:28,840
Wang Hong.

280
00:11:30,960 --> 00:11:32,690
What about your previous name?

281
00:11:34,160 --> 00:11:35,020
Does it matter?

282
00:11:38,720 --> 00:11:39,580
No, it doesn't.

283
00:11:40,880 --> 00:11:42,200
I was just asking.

284
00:11:43,840 --> 00:11:45,370
If you don't want to tell me,

285
00:11:45,800 --> 00:11:47,060
I don't want to hear it.

286
00:11:48,040 --> 00:11:48,840
Xuefei.

287
00:11:49,480 --> 00:11:50,800
If you don't trust me,

288
00:11:51,120 --> 00:11:52,640
it's not too late to back out.

289
00:11:52,640 --> 00:11:54,100
I was being presumptuous.

290
00:12:03,960 --> 00:12:04,840
Tell me,

291
00:12:05,680 --> 00:12:07,680
on the other side of the forest farm,

292
00:12:08,680 --> 00:12:09,440
no,

293
00:12:09,920 --> 00:12:12,450
in a place as far as ten thousand forest farms,

294
00:12:13,240 --> 00:12:14,520
is the moon they see

295
00:12:15,080 --> 00:12:16,840
the same as the one we see?

296
00:12:18,280 --> 00:12:19,480
The sun and the moon

297
00:12:19,680 --> 00:12:21,040
are always the fairest.

298
00:12:21,920 --> 00:12:22,960
Because everyone

299
00:12:23,360 --> 00:12:24,760
looks at the same sky.

300
00:12:26,280 --> 00:12:28,210
That sounds like a line from a play.

301
00:12:29,920 --> 00:12:30,920
Then,

302
00:12:33,520 --> 00:12:34,850
I'll put it another way.

303
00:12:35,320 --> 00:12:36,640
I hope all our wishes

304
00:12:37,480 --> 00:12:38,360
come true.

305
00:12:40,200 --> 00:12:41,460
May we get what we want.

306
00:13:39,080 --> 00:13:39,720
Mr. Wang.

307
00:13:40,360 --> 00:13:41,240
It's so late.

308
00:13:42,520 --> 00:13:43,650
You're still awake?

309
00:13:44,240 --> 00:13:45,240
How did you get in?

310
00:13:46,280 --> 00:13:47,080
Second floor.

311
00:13:47,400 --> 00:13:48,260
It wasn't hard.

312
00:13:49,360 --> 00:13:50,320
I came here today

313
00:13:50,720 --> 00:13:52,450
to discuss something with you.

314
00:13:52,840 --> 00:13:54,760
Is this how you discuss things?

315
00:13:57,360 --> 00:13:58,680
About the hunting ground,

316
00:13:58,680 --> 00:13:59,560
I was wrong.

317
00:14:00,840 --> 00:14:01,920
I apologize.

318
00:14:03,080 --> 00:14:04,680
Please be the bigger person.

319
00:14:05,040 --> 00:14:06,360
Tell Officer Cao

320
00:14:06,760 --> 00:14:08,440
that we were just playing around

321
00:14:08,440 --> 00:14:09,640
and the gun was fake.

322
00:14:09,920 --> 00:14:10,520
Okay?

323
00:14:11,240 --> 00:14:12,440
Name your price.

324
00:14:12,800 --> 00:14:14,240
Go find Cao Jin yourself.

325
00:14:14,560 --> 00:14:15,960
I'm supposed to find him?

326
00:14:16,160 --> 00:14:17,960
He's looking everywhere for me.

327
00:14:19,080 --> 00:14:19,800
Boss Wang,

328
00:14:20,040 --> 00:14:21,240
you're the victim.

329
00:14:21,880 --> 00:14:23,810
They'll definitely listen to you,

330
00:14:25,160 --> 00:14:25,800
right?

331
00:14:26,640 --> 00:14:27,360
Zhao Long.

332
00:14:32,640 --> 00:14:33,440
Boss Zhao.

333
00:14:35,040 --> 00:14:37,280
The color of your eyes

334
00:14:37,520 --> 00:14:38,960
is really different.

335
00:14:44,240 --> 00:14:45,280
Stop pretending.

336
00:14:45,920 --> 00:14:47,120
Sixteen years ago,

337
00:14:47,120 --> 00:14:49,200
Zhao Zhiguo's lumber mill exploded.

338
00:14:50,240 --> 00:14:51,560
His family had a boy.

339
00:14:52,880 --> 00:14:54,280
That boy is you,

340
00:14:55,280 --> 00:14:56,000
right?

341
00:14:57,000 --> 00:14:58,960
But you've really made me curious.

342
00:14:59,520 --> 00:15:01,200
Why did you go through so much trouble

343
00:15:01,200 --> 00:15:03,120
to come back to Xinchun?

344
00:15:03,880 --> 00:15:04,810
To seek revenge?

345
00:15:05,720 --> 00:15:06,640
Or

346
00:15:06,880 --> 00:15:09,680
to find the person who blew up your house back then?

347
00:15:11,320 --> 00:15:12,200
Take a guess.

348
00:15:15,040 --> 00:15:15,800
Boss Zhao.

349
00:15:16,760 --> 00:15:17,840
Let's make a deal.

350
00:15:18,160 --> 00:15:19,680
I'll help you find the person.

351
00:15:19,680 --> 00:15:20,800
Here in Xinchun,

352
00:15:21,080 --> 00:15:23,480
there are things even my dad might not know.

353
00:15:23,720 --> 00:15:25,040
Since I can find a way,

354
00:15:25,040 --> 00:15:27,640
I can definitely help you dig out the evidence.

355
00:15:27,720 --> 00:15:28,360
Why?

356
00:15:29,520 --> 00:15:30,240
What do you mean, why?

357
00:15:30,240 --> 00:15:31,500
Why are you doing this?

358
00:15:31,520 --> 00:15:32,760
Why else?

359
00:15:34,000 --> 00:15:35,240
My dad wants me to leave.

360
00:15:35,240 --> 00:15:36,400
This is my home.

361
00:15:36,400 --> 00:15:37,560
Where can I go?

362
00:15:38,880 --> 00:15:40,340
I'll help you settle this.

363
00:15:41,280 --> 00:15:42,880
You tell the police to let me off.

364
00:15:42,880 --> 00:15:44,280
I'll help you find the person,

365
00:15:44,280 --> 00:15:46,940
and we'll call it even for what happened before.

366
00:15:47,400 --> 00:15:48,680
I'm telling the truth.

367
00:15:48,680 --> 00:15:49,760
Just trust me this once.
